  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "1. Overview",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 19.99,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "PoolingAutomationSynergy is an enterprise desktop application built to\nautomate merchant fund pooling, ACH-based payment processing, and\ncash flow management for organizations that consolidate funds across\nmultiple merchant accounts, client groups, or business locations.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "The application gives finance and treasury teams a single, integrated\nsystem to calculate pooled amounts, move funds through the ACH network,\ntrack payment status end-to-end, reconcile pooled versus processed\namounts, and generate and distribute financial reports — all from one\ndesktop workspace.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "1. Overview"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "heading",
    "text": "2. Business Context",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": 2,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf",
      "font_size": 19.99,
      "bold": true
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Organizations that manage many merchant accounts or business locations\ntypically need to:",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "list",
    "text": "• Consolidate (“pool”) funds across those accounts regularly",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "list",
    "text": "• Move the resulting funds through ACH payment processing",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "list",
    "text": "• Track the status of every payment leg, including rejections and corrections",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "list",
    "text": "• Reconcile what was pooled against what was actually processed",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "list",
    "text": "• Produce accurate, auditable financial reports for internal and client use",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
  {
    "element_type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Handling this manually across many merchant accounts is time-consuming and\nerror-prone. PoolingAutomationSynergy centralizes the entire workflow — from\npooling calculation through payment processing, reconciliation, and reporting —\ninto a single, purpose-built system.",
    "page": 3,
    "heading_level": null,
    "heading_path": [
      "TECSACK SOFTWARE",
      "2. Business Context"
    ],
    "metadata": {
      "extraction_method": "pymupdf"
    }
  },
